                        "entry_id": "36260071-b561-32a2-b314-9971c6ccffe7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An alloy of over 90% aluminium, 4% copper and traces of manganese, magnesium, iron and silicon, widely used in the aircraft industry."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
